@namespace Harborline.UIAdapters.Blazor.Components.Layout
@* DES-0052 layout-eng-30: the authorized receipt, run identity, status and execution trace, verbatim. The linked
   Access trace is read only when its disclosure opens; the platform classifies the read and this derives nothing. *@
<section class="hl-layout-receipt" data-layout-receipt>
  <dl>
    <dt>Run</dt><dd data-layout-run-id>@Receipt.RunId</dd>
    <dt>Status</dt><dd data-layout-run-status>@Receipt.Status</dd>
  </dl>
  <ol aria-label="Execution trace">
    @foreach (var step in Receipt.Trace) { <li data-layout-trace-ordinal="@step.Ordinal">@step.Phase: @step.Status</li> }
  </ol>
  @if (Receipt.AccessDecisionId is not { } decision)
  {
    <p data-layout-access-evidence="absent">@Notices["absent"]</p>
  }
  else
  {
    <details @ontoggle="ToggledAsync">
      <summary>Access decision <span data-layout-access-decision>@decision</span></summary>
      @if (loading) { <p role="status">Loading authorization trace…</p> }
      @if (failed)
      {
        <p role="alert">Unable to read the authorization trace.</p>
        <button type="button" @onclick="LoadAsync">Retry trace read</button>
      }
      @if (trace is { Evidence: "valid" })
      {
        <div data-layout-access-evidence="valid">
          <p data-layout-access-version>Version @trace.Version</p>
          <ol aria-label="Authorization trace">
            @for (var index = 0; index < trace.Stages.Count; index++)
            {
              var stage = trace.Stages[index];
              <li data-layout-access-stage="@stage.Stage">
                <h4>@StageLabels[index]</h4>
                @foreach (var fact in stage.Facts) { <p style="overflow-wrap:anywhere">@fact</p> }
              </li>
            }
          </ol>
          <p data-layout-deciding-grant>Deciding grant: @(trace.DecidingGrant ?? "None recorded")</p>
        </div>
      }
      else if (trace is not null)
      {
        <p data-layout-access-evidence="@trace.Evidence">@Notices[trace.Evidence]</p>
      }
    </details>
  }
</section>

@code {
  [Parameter, EditorRequired] public LayoutRunReceipt Receipt { get; set; } = new("", "", null, []);
  /// <summary>The host's authorized Access trace read, asked by the receipt's decision identity when the disclosure opens.</summary>
  [Parameter, EditorRequired] public Func<string, Task<LayoutAccessTrace>> ReadAccessTrace { get; set; } = _ => throw new InvalidOperationException("No trace read.");
  private static readonly string[] StageLabels = ["Act", "Effective roles", "Standings", "Verdict"];
  private static readonly Dictionary<string, string> Notices = new(StringComparer.Ordinal)
  {
    ["absent"] = "No Access decision was recorded for this run.",
    ["missing"] = "No authorization trace is stored for this decision.",
    ["forbidden"] = "You may not read this authorization trace.",
    ["malformed"] = "The stored authorization trace is malformed.",
  };
  private LayoutAccessTrace? trace;
  private bool open;
  private bool loading;
  private bool failed;

  // Blazor's toggle carries no state, so the disclosure's open state is tracked here; closing never reads.
  private Task ToggledAsync()
  {
    open = !open;
    return open && trace is null ? LoadAsync() : Task.CompletedTask;
  }

  private async Task LoadAsync()
  {
    if (Receipt.AccessDecisionId is not { } decision || loading) return;
    loading = true;
    failed = false;
    try { trace = await ReadAccessTrace(decision); }
    catch (Exception) { failed = true; }
    finally { loading = false; }
  }
}
